      "license": "MIT",
      "notes": [
        "The exported Matrix preserves Matrix arrangement=grid for authored comparison cells and arrangement=choices for content-sized native RadioGroup rows. Choices accepts one or more library columns and unbounded leaf rows without an internal scroll region.",
        "The explicit library-board configuration selects LibraryBoardSection typed columns, rows and controls records through LIBRARY_BOARD_CONFIG; its canonical member is arrangement.library-board. Grid remains the existing literal. Selected runtime qualification remains separate.",
        "The choices assembly consumes SectionHeader, RadioGroup, Card, Badge, Tooltip and token-backed table layout; Studio supplies checked token, asset or component previews.",
        "Source-only import and token-read measurements are lower bounds; shared anatomy, accessibility, contrast and consumer runtime conformance remain unmeasured. Content bindings describe host adaptation points, not type-equivalent converters."
